---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Ph from '../components/Ph.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Xpress Entertainment" description="Xpress Entertainment's privacy policy. How we collect, store, and protect your information, our SMS opt-in/opt-out terms, and how we use the Vibo planning app.">

  <header class="hero" style="min-height:46svh;">
    <div class="hero-bg"><Ph w={2560} h={1440} label="Privacy — hero" note="Subtle wedding background" /></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow light reveal">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="h-xl reveal d1" style="margin-top:14px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="pad bg-ink">
    <div class="wrap legal" style="max-width:780px;">
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> May 20, 2026</p>
      <p>Welcome to Xpress Entertainment (xpressdjs.com). Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what we collect, how we use it, and the rights you have over it when you interact with our website, booking process, the Vibo planning app, and our SMS communications.</p>

      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>Xpress Entertainment Corp is a South Florida wedding and event entertainment company headquartered in Pembroke Pines, FL, serving Broward, Miami-Dade, and Palm Beach counties.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>Information you give us (name, email, phone, and event details when you submit a form or sign a contract), planning information you add to the Vibo app, and usage data collected automatically (device, browser, pages visited) via cookies.</p>

      <h2>SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
      <p>By providing your phone number, you agree to receive automated and non-automated texts related to your event and our services. Message and data rates may apply; frequency varies. Consent is <strong>not</strong> a condition of booking. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt out at any time, or <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. We never sell or share your number for third-party marketing.</p>

      <h2>How We Use & Store Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to respond to inquiries, plan and perform your event, send updates, and meet legal obligations. Data is stored on encrypted, password-protected platforms, with access limited to team members who need it. We never store full credit card numbers on our servers.</p>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with trusted service providers (such as Vibo and our payment processor) under confidentiality, with your assigned DJ for planning, and with legal authorities when required by law.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request a copy of, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and withdraw consent for marketing at any time. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:events@xpressdjs.com">events@xpressdjs.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Xpress Entertainment Corp · Pembroke Pines, FL · <a href="mailto:events@xpressdjs.com">events@xpressdjs.com</a> · <a href="tel:9542330698">954-233-0698</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal :global(h2) { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.7rem; color: #fff; margin: 34px 0 12px; }
    .legal :global(p) { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .legal :global(strong) { color: #fff; }
    .legal :global(a) { color: var(--red); text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</Base>
